### Page 1 of 4

```text
Planning and Development Office
2101 O’Neil Avenue, Suite 202, Cheyenne WY 82001
(Phone) 307-637-6282
(Fax) 307-637-6366

January 17, 2018

City Council
City of Cheyenne, WY

RE: Treadway Subdivision

On January 17, 2018, the agent for the applicant for Treadway Subdivision submitted a revised final plat
map to City Staff. City Staff has reviewed the revised map and has determined that the revised map has
fulfilled all of the conditions as listed in the Staff Report.

This is the second revised map for this subdivision. The purpose of the second revised map is to address
concerns put forward under the Laramie County review process.

Staff recommends approval of Treadway Subdivision with revised map dated 1/17/2018 with no
conditions.

Treadway Subdivision was item #20 on the January 8, 2018 City Council Agenda (and was listed as item
#20 on the agenda for the Public Services Committee on January 17, 2018).

Regards,

Seth Lloyd
Planner

Encl:
Treadway Subdivision revised map dated 1/17/2018

Cc:
City Clerk

City Attorney

Mayor’s office

  Planning and Development Department
2101 O’Neil Avenue, Suite 202, Cheyenne WY 82001
(Phone) 307-637-6282 (Fax) 307-637-6366
