RE: Treadway Subdivision

On January 3, 2018, the agent for the applicant for Treadway Subdivision submitted a revised final plat
map to City Staff. City Staff has reviewed the revised map and has determined that the revised map has
fulfilled all of the conditions as listed in the Staff Report.

Staff recommends approval of Treadway Subdivision with revised map with no conditions.

Treadway Subdivision was item #20 on the January 8, 2018 City Council Agenda (and is listed as item
#20 on the agenda for the Public Services Committee on January 17, 2018).

